" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the range of $\\operatorname{csc}⁡x$ for $0\\le x<2\\pi $ is given by\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\in (-\\infty ,-1]\\cup [1,\\infty ).\n$$\n\nSo, the equation $\\operatorname{csc}⁡x=k$ has no solutions for $k\\in (-1,1).$ \n\nTherefore, of the given equations, only equation $\\operatorname{csc}⁡x=\\frac{4}{5}$ has no solutions."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186256520 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054632 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "495f3da0-849a-589d-ac88-26d6825445e4" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying True Statements About Subsets" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050923 :topic/id #uuid "723d1f9c-b696-511c-b5e5-88c045fe7609" :topic/math-academy-id 50 :topic/title "Subsets"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4dc7a6c2-ba2d-58fe-9809-c8a2e62ab9a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448102} {:answer/id #uuid "f83abbc0-81b1-5423-9411-39e57332b5b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448103}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4dc7a6c2-ba2d-58fe-9809-c8a2e62ab9a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448102} :answer-field/id #uuid "eddaff1a-a5b2-51f6-a80b-b6a66ebde808" :answer-field/key "$A⊆B$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449091} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2baba46a-66d2-585e-b78c-e1a30ee1baba" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448104} {:answer/id #uuid "80bf77cc-25ad-5cef-aea0-a44fb7faa19d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448105}] :ans