/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448151}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "02c44eed-233d-5ab9-b232-1f55f5c23ff4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448150} :answer-field/id #uuid "9cec0683-efdd-5dfb-a194-1aced1608d2e" :answer-field/key "The transformation $T$ is orientation-preserving" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449115}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d6b75fa0-1178-5417-bc31-861bbdef5229" :question/math-academy-id "q-124321" :question/problem "Consider the affine transformation $T$ defined as\n\n$$\nx=2v-u+2,\\,y=2u+v-5.\n$$\n\nLet $A$ be the matrix representation of the linear transformation associated with $T.$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "An affine transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ is a function of the form\n\n$$\nx=Au+b,\n$$\n\nwhere $x,u,$ and $b$ are column vectors in ${R}^{2},$ and $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nLet's look at each statement in turn:\n\n- Statement $A=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$ is true. Indeed, notice that the given transformation can be expressed as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2v-u+2 \\\\ 2u+v-5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-u+2v \\\\ 2u+v\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}}_{A}\\cdot \\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}}_{u}+\\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}}_{b}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the matrix representation of the linear transformation associated with $T$ is $A=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n- Statement $det(A)=-5$ is true. Indeed, computing the determinant of $A,$ we get\n\n$$\ndet(A)=\\begin{vmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{vmatrix}=(-1)\\cdot 1-2\\cdot 2=-5.\n$$\n\n- Statement “The transformation $T$ is orientation-preserving” is false. Since $det(A)<0,$ the affine transformation $T$ is not orientation-preserving.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $A=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$; $det(A)=-5$ only." :step/_content [{:activity/_steps {:activity/scope {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049035 :topic/id #uuid "d53c1458-9af5-589b-8d7b-d3dbe4e7a946" :topic/math-academy-id 3706 :topic/title "The Image of an Affine Transformation"} :activity/title "The Image of an Affine Transformation" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :activity.type/review} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186408039} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186408040}]} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259663 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179769 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "36996ffc-7dbc-51f8-8efe-46ed2c897045" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether an Affine Transformation is Orientation-Preserving" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049035 :topic/id #uuid "d53c1458-9af5-589b-8d7b-d3dbe4e7a946" :topic/math-academy-id 3706 :topic/title "The Image of an Affine Transformation"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1276ca3f-0817-57d0-81fc-4cf3b2b8c257" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448152} {:answer/id #uuid "743f6540-a3a1-5ce5-96a0-66ce9f284993" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448153}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "743f6540-a3a1-5ce5-96a0-66ce9f284993" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448153} :answer-field/id #uuid "e00b185e-48ee-59bd-8245-84a19a005d69" :answer-field/key "$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449116} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0bef7659-decf-5b82-a6f5-3aa7e1134ac2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448154} {:answer/id #uuid "e16c8594-f347-5ced-a1db-0cbf8d2cab8e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448155}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0bef7659-decf-5b82-a6f5-3aa7e1134ac2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448154} :answer-field/id #uuid "5b28f605-aebe-5cbd-9d68-1760caa655fb" :answer-field/key "$det(A)=1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449117} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c41386b4-b3e8-58e2-8d35-a3b72f57dc4b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448156} {:answer/id #uuid "15e896ce-491a-591b-b5ca-d06c641aa278" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448157}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c41386b4-b3e8-58e2-8d35-a3b72f57dc4b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448156} :answer-field/id #uuid "3bd8e212-89b2-5734-8a82-96a437a9526f" :answer-field/key "The transformation $T$ is orientation-preserving" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449118}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "8bc55bfe-e692-5546-9ff3-60dd10f588d6" :question/math-academy-id "q-124322" :question/problem "Consider the affine transformation $T$ defined as\n\n$$\nx=u+3v-5,\\,y=2v+u-4.\n$$\n\nLet $A$ be the matrix representation of the linear transformation associated with $T.$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "An affine transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ is a function of the form\n\n$$\nx=Au+b,\n$$\n\nwhere $x,u,$ and $b$ are column vectors in ${R}^{2},$ and $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nLet's look at each statement in turn:\n\n- Statement $A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$ is true. Indeed, notice that the given transformation can be expressed as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}u+3v-5 \\\\ 2v+u-4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}u+3v \\\\ u+2v\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}}_{A}\\cdot \\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}}_{u}+\\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}}_{b}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the matrix representation of the linear transformation associated with $T$ is $A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n- Statement $det(A)=1$ is false. Computing the determinant of $A,$ we get\n\n$$\ndet(A)=\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{vmatrix}=1\\cdot 2-1\\cdot 3=-1.\n$$\n\n- Statement “The transformation $T$ is orientation-preserving” is false. Since $det(A)<0,$ the affine transformation $T$ is not orientation-preserving.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259664 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179769 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "36996ffc-7dbc-51f8-8efe-46ed2c897045" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether an Affine Transformation is Orientation-Preserving" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049035 :topic/id #uuid "d53c1458-9af5-589b-8d7b-d3dbe4e7a946" :topic/math-academy-id 3706 :topic/title "The Image of an Affine Transformation"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5b403f00-fca0-57ea-8284-891bf3566a31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448158} {:answer/id #uuid "843732ab-6614-502e-a8d6-137dd6b219b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448159}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5b403f00-fca0-57ea-8284-891bf3566a31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448158} :answer-field/id #uuid "1800fb93-626f-555b-8257-53399e2b3330" :answer-field/key "$A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449119} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d03837d5-08d1-515b-abb3-46fa51e14d5e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448160} {:answer/id #uuid "5db7ee30-ef80-5d31-b01c-bfcff70810a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448161}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5db7ee30-ef80-5d31-b01c-bfcff70810a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448161} :answer-field/id #uuid "fec20ecf-0d1a-5d88-aabc-f6faea141357" :answer-field/key "$det(A)=2$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449120} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b74f99e4-3864-593f-90c0-b004a433a43e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text}