a44-1e2d-5473-a243-1b09bbe1be18" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448174} :answer-field/id #uuid "2da6067f-c334-515f-9b43-3cc92f6a6399" :answer-field/key "The transformation $T$ is orientation-preserving" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449127}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "2083542b-ea7a-58bb-b614-773ec287a63e" :question/math-academy-id "q-124327" :question/problem "Consider the affine transformation $T$ defined as\n\n$$\nx=v-2u,\\,y=u+3v-1.\n$$\n\nLet $A$ be the matrix representation of the linear transformation associated with $T.$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "An affine transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ is a function of the form\n\n$$\nx=Au+b,\n$$\n\nwhere $x,u,$ and $b$ are column vectors in ${R}^{2},$ and $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nLet's look at each statement in turn:\n\n- Statement $A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$ is false. Notice that the given transformation can be expressed as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}v-2u \\\\ u+3v-1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2u+v \\\\ u+3v\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}}_{A}\\cdot \\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}}_{u}+\\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}}_{b}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the matrix representation of the linear transformation associated with $T$ is $A=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n- Statement $det(A)=-7$ is true. Computing the determinant of $A,$ we get\n\n$$\ndet(A)=\\begin{vmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{vmatrix}=(-2)\\cdot 3-1\\cdot 1=-7.\n$$\n\n- Statement “The transformation $T$ is orientation-preserving” is false. Since $det(A)<0,$ the affine transformation $T$ is not orientation-preserving.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $det(A)=-7$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259668 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179769 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "36996ffc-7dbc-51f8-8efe-46ed2c897045" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether an Affine Transformation is Orientation-Preserving" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049035 :topic/id #uuid "d53c1458-9af5-589b-8d7b-d3dbe4e7a946" :topic/math-academy-id 3706 :topic/title "The Image of an Affine Transformation"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "408d4376-fee3-576b-b919-78a362304433" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448176} {:answer/id #uuid "8fd32334-9fe7-58f0-b69d-c5e4b56cf483" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448177}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "408d4376-fee3-576b-b919-78a362304433" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448176} :answer-field/id #uuid "8ddf5a2c-e1ba-5ab8-a326-ef2effad6657" :answer-field/key "$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449128} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "267cd5a9-bfac-5eed-8904-017678ad4a9b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448178} {:answer/id #uuid "53ccc33d-0646-52ce-a1eb-2f220bd004a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448179}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "267cd5a9-bfac-5eed-8904-0176